{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_1_level_main_01-12_beg","groupId":"main_1","stageId":"main_01-12","title":"代価","storyCode":"1-12","avgTag":"戦闘前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-12_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b5c965488fcbe1c5d5f6d96ecdb04325bc1ae8f8841cf5f0b28895c5b0abf4ab","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"チェルノボーグからの撤退が目前となったところへ、招かれざる客――Wが現れる。\n彼女の嘲笑に満ちた問いかけに、アーミヤは怯むことなく答えを出した。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十二关（前）\n時刻不明 / 天候不明 / 視界：低\nチェルノボーグ 行動隊E0現在地\nDr.{@nickname}救出作戦 最終撤退段階"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"くっ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"出口は目の前だというのに……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"あ～ら、簡単に出られるとでも思ってたのかしら？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"そんな夢見ちゃってるようなら、目を覚まさせてあげないとね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"……ロドス各員、聞いてくれ。通信が回復して、待機していた行動予備隊に連絡がついた。じきに増援が来るぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"とはいえ、目下の問題はあの女だが……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"！　気をつけろ、彼女は爆弾を持っているようだ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"チッ……偵察部隊のほうにはまだ連絡がつかないというのに、こんな時に……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――あなたは、一体誰なんですか？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"そうねえ……あんたに知られてないのは当然のことだけど――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"隣にいるそいつになら、わかってもらえるんじゃないかしら？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……レユニオンのメンバー、ですよね。まだ仕掛けてくるつもりですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"ちょっと、そういう言い方しないでよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"あたし、タルラとはそりが合わないの。それに、今は派手にやり合うつもりもないわ。一仕事終えたあとだから、疲れてるしね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"なんなら、友好の証に自己紹介でもしましょうか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"あたしのことは「W」って呼んでちょうだい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ、ついでに、ここで待ってた理由も伝えておこうかしら。――あたしね、あんたの隣のその人に会いたかったのよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……ドクターに、ですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@Nickname}......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"だから……悪いけど、こっちに引き渡してくれない？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"論ずるに値せん提案だな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"まあまあ、そんなにカリカリしないでよ。もうちょっと仲良くお喋りしましょう？　手土産として、興味を持ってもらえそうな情報も持ってきたんだから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"実はさっき、そこで腕に覚えがありそうな集団に出くわしたの。……考えてみたら、あんたたちと似たような格好に見えたわねえ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"まあ、ちょっとした変装はしてたみたいだけど……ウルサス人なら騙せても、あたしの目は誤魔化せないわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……！　偵察部隊のみなさんでしょうか……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"良かった……無事だったんですね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"ところで、あんたがあいつらのボスなのよね？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"っ……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"よかったら、参考までに教えてくれないかしら？　一体どんなアーツを使って、あの連中をあんたのためなら喜んで死ぬ下僕に仕立て上げたのか……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"えっ……？　何を言って……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"わからない？　あいつらはもう戻ってこない、って言ってるの。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"――ねえ、ウサギさん……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"あんたには本当に、他人を犠牲にしてまで、守ってもらうほどの価値があるのかしら？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――ッ……！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"相手にするな、アーミヤ！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"アーミヤ……","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"W……！　なぜそんなことを……！","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"お医者さんはまだ黙っててちょうだい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"――で、ウサギさん？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"あんた、もしかして怒ってんの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……彼らは、下僕などではありません。命を賭して戦ったのは、みなさん自身の意志があるからです……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"アハッ、やる気になっちゃった？　いいわよ、相手してあげる。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"かかってきなさい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――W。あなたは、言ってはいけないことを口にしました。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"すべての命には、等しく価値があるんです。それなのに、あなたはそれを踏みにじった……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"彼らの命への冒涜を、許すわけにはいきません！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ドクター！！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"――総員、戦闘準備！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"フフッ……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["ドーベルマン"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["ニアール"]},{"speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","aliases":["？？？","W"]}]}
